Q: What&#39;s a good Javascript ES6 way to pass the UTM (Urchin Tracking Module) parameters from my query string? A: <p>Most educated decision. The following code extracts only utm tags for further use</p>
<pre><code>const utm_keys = ['utm_source', 'utm_medium', 'utm_campaign', 'utm_content', 'utm_term'];
